            "body": "Ehsaan apni Didi ke saath school ke science museum gaya tha, jahan deewar par ek badi periodic table aur mass spectrometer ka poster laga tha. Ehsaan ne dhyan se dekha aur apni Didi se poochha, \"Didi, Boron ke nucleus mein protons aur neutrons to poori ginti mein hote hain — ya to 10 honge ya 11. Phir is wall chart par Boron ka atomic mass **10.81 u** aur Chlorine ka **35.45 u** decimal mein kyun likha hai? Kya koi 0.81 neutron bhi hota hai?\"\n\nDidi hans padin: \"Bilkul nahi Ehsaan! Koi aadha-adhoora neutron nahi hota. Prakriti mein Boron ke do tarah ke atoms (**isotopes**) milte hain: halka **¹⁰B** lagbhag 20% aur bhaari **¹¹B** lagbhag 80%. Jab tum lab mein ek chutki Boron uthate ho, to usmein dono isotopes ka yahi mishran hota hai — aur inka **weighted average** theek **10.81 u** aata hai!\"\n\nEhsaan ko baat turant chamak gayi: periodic table ka atomic mass kisi ek atom ka nahi, balki prakriti ke saare isotopes ka **weighted average** hota hai. Chalo iska ganit aur Class 11 ka formula-detective method seekhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ehsaan apni Didi ke saath school ke science museum gaya tha, jahan deewar par ek badi periodic table aur mass spectrometer ka poster laga tha. Ehsaan ne dhyan se dekha aur apni Didi se poochha, \"Didi, Boron ke nucleus mein protons aur neutrons to poori ginti mein hote hain — ya to 10 honge ya 11. Phir is wall chart par Boron ka atomic mass **10.81 u** aur Chlorine ka **35.45 u** decimal mein kyun likha hai? Kya koi 0.81 neutron bhi hota hai?\"\n\nDidi hans padin: \"Bilkul nahi Ehsaan! Koi aadha-adhoora neutron nahi hota. Prakriti mein Boron ke do tarah ke atoms (**isotopes**) milte hain: halka **¹⁰B** lagbhag 20% aur bhaari **¹¹B** lagbhag 80%. Jab tum lab mein ek chutki Boron uthate ho, to usmein dono isotopes ka yahi mishran hota hai — aur inka **weighted average** theek **10.81 u** aata hai!\"\n\nEhsaan ko baat turant chamak gayi: periodic table ka atomic mass kisi ek atom ka nahi, balki prakriti ke saare isotopes ka **weighted average** hota hai. Chalo iska ganit aur Class 11 ka formula-detective method seekhte hain."
