            "heading": "Key Vocabulary & Terms",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Unified atomic mass unit (u)** | Ek ¹²C atom ke theek 1/12वें hisse ka mass (1 u = 1.66056 × 10⁻²⁴ g) | 1 ¹²C atom = 12 u (exact) |\n| **Average atomic mass** | Kisi tatva ke sabhi prakritik isotopes ke masses ka unki % abundance ke hisaab se weighted average | Boron = 10.81 u, Chlorine = 35.45 u |\n| **Relative abundance** | Prakriti mein kisi tatva ke total atoms mein ek khas isotope ka pratishat (%) | ¹⁰B = 19.9%, ¹¹B = 80.1% |\n| **Avogadro constant (Nₐ)** | Ek mole mein kanon ki pakki ginti: 6.02214076 × 10²³ mol⁻¹ (hisab mein 6.022 × 10²³ mol⁻¹) | 1 mol H₂O mein 6.022 × 10²³ molecules |\n| **Combustion analysis** | Kisi organic compound (C, H ya C, H, O) ko poori tarah O₂ mein jalakar bane CO₂ aur H₂O ke masses se C, H aur O ka mass nikaalna | 0.450 g compound → 0.660 g CO₂ + 0.270 g H₂O |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Unified atomic mass unit (u)** | Ek ¹²C atom ke theek 1/12वें hisse ka mass (1 u = 1.66056 × 10⁻²⁴ g) | 1 ¹²C atom = 12 u (exact) |\n| **Average atomic mass** | Kisi tatva ke sabhi prakritik isotopes ke masses ka unki % abundance ke hisaab se weighted average | Boron = 10.81 u, Chlorine = 35.45 u |\n| **Relative abundance** | Prakriti mein kisi tatva ke total atoms mein ek khas isotope ka pratishat (%) | ¹⁰B = 19.9%, ¹¹B = 80.1% |\n| **Avogadro constant (Nₐ)** | Ek mole mein kanon ki pakki ginti: 6.02214076 × 10²³ mol⁻¹ (hisab mein 6.022 × 10²³ mol⁻¹) | 1 mol H₂O mein 6.022 × 10²³ molecules |\n| **Combustion analysis** | Kisi organic compound (C, H ya C, H, O) ko poori tarah O₂ mein jalakar bane CO₂ aur H₂O ke masses se C, H aur O ka mass nikaalna | 0.450 g compound → 0.660 g CO₂ + 0.270 g H₂O |"
