            "heading": "Chapter Summary & Wrap-Up",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter Ka Saar: Some Basic Concepts of Chemistry",
            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Topic 1: Maapan aur Uncertainty** | Chemistry ka mahatva, intensive vs extensive properties, °C/K/°F, dimensional analysis, sig-fig arithmetic aur even-digit rounding | Har chemistry measurement ke saath uski unit aur precision judi hoti hai — jod-ghata mein decimal places aur guna-bhaag mein sig figs dekhte hain. |\n| **Topic 2: Laws of Combination aur Dalton** | Paanchon chemical combination ke niyam, Law of Multiple Proportions (ek tatva ka mass fix karo!) aur Dalton ki theory ki strengths va limitations | Fixed mass of A ke saath B ka ratio hamesha simple whole numbers mein aata hai; Dalton ne Laws 1–3 samjhaye par gases aur isotopes par ruk gaya. |\n| **Topic 3: Isotopes, Mole aur Combustion Analysis** | Unified mass u, isotopes se average atomic mass (forward aur reverse), combustion analysis (CO₂/H₂O se C, H, O) aur hydrated salt formula | Periodic table ke decimal masses isotopes ka weighted average hain, aur combustion ke CO₂/H₂O se kisi bhi organic compound ka molecular formula nikal aata hai. |\n| **Topic 4: Limiting Reagent aur Solutions** | Limiting & excess reagent, percentage yield, Mole Fraction (χ), Molarity (M), dilution (M₁V₁ = M₂V₂), mixing, Molality (m) aur M–m–density pul | Sabse chhota moles ÷ coefficient limiting reagent hai; Molarity volume (T-dependent) par aur Molality solvent mass (T-independent) par chalti hai. |\n| **Topic 5: Sab Kuch Mila Kar** | Combustion + limiting reagent, impure sample + molar HCl (% purity), aur mass % + density se M, m, χ | Chahe sawaal kitna bhi lamba ho, pehle moles (n) tak pahuncho — wahi poore chapter ka master pul hai. |\n\n---\n\nShabaash! Ab tum Class 11 Chemistry ki poori buniyaad — precision, laws, isotopes, combustion analysis, limiting reagent aur solutions — par poori pakad bana chuke ho!\n\n**Agle Chapter Mein Kya Hai?** Topic 2 mein humne dekha ki Dalton ka \"indivisible atom\" toot kar electrons, protons aur neutrons mein khul gaya — par ye subatomic particles atom ke andar aakhir baithe kaise hote hain, aur electrons nucleus ke chaaron taraf kaise ghoomte hain? Ye poora raaz khulega agle chapter **Structure of Atom** mein!",
