            "heading": "Geetika aur TV-repair bench par chumbak se mudti hari kiran",
            "headingHinglish": "Geetika aur TV-repair bench par chumbak se mudti hari kiran",
            "body": "Geetika apne Papa ke saath mohalle ki purani electronics workshop mein ek purana Cathode Ray Oscilloscope (CRT monitor) theek karwane gayi thi. *(Suraksha: CRT tube ke andar bahut high voltage hota hai, isliye Geetika aur Papa ne use sirf door se dekha; koi bhi student purane TV ya CRT ko kabhi khol kar nahi chhoota!)*\n\nMechanic bhaiya ne screen par ek chamakdar hari dot dikhayi aur tube ke bahar ek chhota bar magnet laate hi wo hari dot ek taraf mud gayi! Geetika ne poochha, \"Papa, agar ye sirf roshni hoti, to chumbak se to roshni nahi mudti! Ye hari dot chumbak se kyun khinch gayi?\"\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Kyunki is glass tube ke andar roshni nahi, balki **electrons ki tez dhaar (cathode rays)** daud rahi hai! Jab we screen ke zinc sulphide (ZnS) coating se takraati hain, to hara ujala nikalti hain. 1897 mein J. J. Thomson ne bilkul aise hi electric aur magnetic fields se in rays ko mod kar electron ka **e/m ratio** naapa tha — aur uske 12 saal baad Millikan ne ek tel ki boond par electron ka exact charge pakda!\" Chalo, is poori khoj ke numbers aur models ki seemayein samajhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Geetika apne Papa ke saath mohalle ki purani electronics workshop mein ek purana Cathode Ray Oscilloscope (CRT monitor) theek karwane gayi thi. *(Suraksha: CRT tube ke andar bahut high voltage hota hai, isliye Geetika aur Papa ne use sirf door se dekha; koi bhi student purane TV ya CRT ko kabhi khol kar nahi chhoota!)*\n\nMechanic bhaiya ne screen par ek chamakdar hari dot dikhayi aur tube ke bahar ek chhota bar magnet laate hi wo hari dot ek taraf mud gayi! Geetika ne poochha, \"Papa, agar ye sirf roshni hoti, to chumbak se to roshni nahi mudti! Ye hari dot chumbak se kyun khinch gayi?\"\n\nPapa muskuraye: \"Kyunki is glass tube ke andar roshni nahi, balki **electrons ki tez dhaar (cathode rays)** daud rahi hai! Jab we screen ke zinc sulphide (ZnS) coating se takraati hain, to hara ujala nikalti hain. 1897 mein J. J. Thomson ne bilkul aise hi electric aur magnetic fields se in rays ko mod kar electron ka **e/m ratio** naapa tha — aur uske 12 saal baad Millikan ne ek tel ki boond par electron ka exact charge pakda!\" Chalo, is poori khoj ke numbers aur models ki seemayein samajhte hain."
