            "body": "Topic 1 ke ant mein hum ek badi uljhan par ruke the: Rutherford ka atom stability aur hydrogen ke patle line spectrum ko nahi samjha paaya. Is paheli ki chaabi **roshni (electromagnetic radiation)** ke andar chhupi thi! 1900 mein Max Planck aur 1905 mein Albert Einstein ne dikhaya ki light sirf ek lagatar lehar (wave) nahi, balki energy ke chhote-chhote packets (**photons**) ki dhaar bhi hai. Isi quantum idea ko lekar 1913 mein Niels Bohr ne hydrogen atom ka exact mathematical model banaya. Aaj hum wave equations, photoelectric effect, hydrogen spectral series aur Bohr ke exact radius tatha energy formulas seekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 ke ant mein hum ek badi uljhan par ruke the: Rutherford ka atom stability aur hydrogen ke patle line spectrum ko nahi samjha paaya. Is paheli ki chaabi **roshni (electromagnetic radiation)** ke andar chhupi thi! 1900 mein Max Planck aur 1905 mein Albert Einstein ne dikhaya ki light sirf ek lagatar lehar (wave) nahi, balki energy ke chhote-chhote packets (**photons**) ki dhaar bhi hai. Isi quantum idea ko lekar 1913 mein Niels Bohr ne hydrogen atom ka exact mathematical model banaya. Aaj hum wave equations, photoelectric effect, hydrogen spectral series aur Bohr ke exact radius tatha energy formulas seekhenge!"
