            "body": "Kapil apni Mummy ke saath raat ki double-decker sleeper bus mein chadha. Bus mein neeche aur upar alag-alag berths the, aur har berth mein adhiktam do log baith sakte the. Kapil ne dhyan se dekha ki musafir teen ajeeb niyamon se baith rahe the:\n1. Sabse pehle sabse **aasaan aur nichle level** wali seats bharti thin — koi bhi bina zaroorat upar ki oonchi seat par nahi chadhta tha.\n2. Jab ek hi row mein teen khaali double-berths hote, to naye musafir pehle **ek-ek karke teeno khaali berths mein akele** baithte the; pairing (doosra saathi bithana) tabhi shuru hoti jab koi khaali berth na bache!\n3. Aur jab do log ek hi double-berth share karte, to takraane se bachne ke liye dono **ulte siron (opposite directions)** ki taraf muh karke baithte the!\n\nKapil muskuraya: \"Mummy, ye teeno aadat to bilkul atom ke electrons jaisi hain! Pehla niyam **Aufbau**, doosra **Hund's Rule**, aur teesra **Pauli Exclusion Principle**!\" Chalo, in teeno niyamon aur Cr/Cu ke khas jaadu ko dekhte hain.",
