            "headingHinglish": "Aam galtiyan (bachke rehna)",
            "body": "1. **Galti 1: Z = 102 ya 112 mein \"biium\" aur Z = 103 ya 113 mein \"triium\" likh dena.**\n   *Sahi baat:* Do 'i' ek saath nahi aate! Sahi spelling **Unnilbium (Unb)**, **Ununbium (Uub)**, **Unniltrium (Unt)** aur **Ununtrium (Uut)** hai.\n\n2. **Galti 2: 9 aur 0 saath aane par \"ennnil\" likh dena.**\n   Z = 190 (kalpanik udhaharan) mein un + enn + nil + ium jodte waqt teen 'n' ban jaate hain.\n   *Sahi baat:* Ek 'n' hatakar **Unennilium (Uen)** likha jaata hai!\n\n3. **Galti 3: Moseley ke plot ko \"ν vs Z\" likh dena.**\n   Seedhi rekha frequency ν ke saath nahi, balki **√ν (square root of frequency)** banaam **Z** ke saath milti hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Galti 1: Z = 102 ya 112 mein \"biium\" aur Z = 103 ya 113 mein \"triium\" likh dena.**\n   *Sahi baat:* Do 'i' ek saath nahi aate! Sahi spelling **Unnilbium (Unb)**, **Ununbium (Uub)**, **Unniltrium (Unt)** aur **Ununtrium (Uut)** hai.\n\n2. **Galti 2: 9 aur 0 saath aane par \"ennnil\" likh dena.**\n   Z = 190 (kalpanik udhaharan) mein un + enn + nil + ium jodte waqt teen 'n' ban jaate hain.\n   *Sahi baat:* Ek 'n' hatakar **Unennilium (Uen)** likha jaata hai!\n\n3. **Galti 3: Moseley ke plot ko \"ν vs Z\" likh dena.**\n   Seedhi rekha frequency ν ke saath nahi, balki **√ν (square root of frequency)** banaam **Z** ke saath milti hai!"
