            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Block (s, p, d, f)** | Wo subshell jismein kisi tatva ka aakhri (differentiating) electron bharta hai | Na (3s¹) → s-block; Fe (3d⁶4s²) → d-block |\n| **Representative (Main-group) elements** | s-block aur p-block ke sabhi tatva (Groups 1, 2 aur 13–18) | Na, Mg, C, N, O, Cl |\n| **Transition elements** | d-block ke wo tatva jinke atom ya aam ion mein **partially filled d-orbital (d¹ se d⁹)** ho | Fe, Cu, V (Zn, Cd, Hg nahi!) |\n| **Inner-transition elements** | f-block ke tatva — **Lanthanoids** (4f, Z = 58–71) aur **Actinoids** (5f, Z = 90–103) — sabhi Group 3 mein | Ce (58), Gd (64), U (92) |\n| **Transuranium elements** | Uranium (Z = 92) ke baad aane wale sabhi manav-nirmit radioactive tatva (Z ≥ 93) | Neptunium (93), Plutonium (94) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Block (s, p, d, f)** | Wo subshell jismein kisi tatva ka aakhri (differentiating) electron bharta hai | Na (3s¹) → s-block; Fe (3d⁶4s²) → d-block |\n| **Representative (Main-group) elements** | s-block aur p-block ke sabhi tatva (Groups 1, 2 aur 13–18) | Na, Mg, C, N, O, Cl |\n| **Transition elements** | d-block ke wo tatva jinke atom ya aam ion mein **partially filled d-orbital (d¹ se d⁹)** ho | Fe, Cu, V (Zn, Cd, Hg nahi!) |\n| **Inner-transition elements** | f-block ke tatva — **Lanthanoids** (4f, Z = 58–71) aur **Actinoids** (5f, Z = 90–103) — sabhi Group 3 mein | Ce (58), Gd (64), U (92) |\n| **Transuranium elements** | Uranium (Z = 92) ke baad aane wale sabhi manav-nirmit radioactive tatva (Z ≥ 93) | Neptunium (93), Plutonium (94) |"
