            "body": "Class 10 ([periodic-properties.md](../../../class10/chemistry/periodic-properties/periodic-properties.md), [periodic-properties-part2.md](../../../class10/chemistry/periodic-properties/periodic-properties-part2.md) aur [periodic-properties-part3.md](../../../class10/chemistry/periodic-properties/periodic-properties-part3.md)) mein tumne teen aasaan trends yaad kiye the: period mein baayein se daayein size ghat-ta hai, ionisation energy badhti hai aur electron attraction badhta hai. Class 11 mein hum **orbitals (Chapter 2)** ki madad se in trends ke **asli bheed-bhaad wale exceptions** samajhte hain: **van der Waals radius** covalent radius se bada kyun hota hai, **Be ki ionisation enthalpy B se aur N ki O se ZYADA kyun hai**, aur sabse mashhoor paheli — **Chlorine ki electron gain enthalpy Fluorine se zyada negative kyun hai**!",
