            "body": "Class 9 ([chemical-bonding.md](../../../class9/chemistry/chemical-bonding/chemical-bonding.md) se [chemical-bonding-part3.md](../../../class9/chemistry/chemical-bonding/chemical-bonding-part3.md)) aur Class 10 ([chemical-bonding-ii-part3.md](../../../class10/chemistry/chemical-bonding-ii/chemical-bonding-ii-part3.md)) mein tumne octet rule, ionic bond, covalent bond aur coordinate bond ki buniyaad seekhi thi. Class 11 mein hum teen bade naye sawaalon ka jawab dete hain: (1) ionic crystal (jaise NaCl) itna stable kyun hota hai (**Lattice Enthalpy**), (2) jab ek hi polyatomic ion ke kai Lewis structures ban sakein to sabse achha structure kaise chunein (**Formal Charge**), aur (3) jab ek akela Lewis structure molecule ki barabar bond lengths ko samjha na paaye (jaise Ozone O₃ aur Carbonate CO₃²⁻), to **Resonance Hybrid** kaise kaam karta hai!",
