            "heading": "Malhar aur biology corner par khachchar (mule) ka poster",
            "headingHinglish": "Malhar aur biology corner par khachchar (mule) ka poster",
            "body": "Malhar apne school ke biology corner mein ek chart dekh raha tha: ek taraf ghoda (horse), doosri taraf gadha (donkey), aur beech mein **khachchar (mule)**. Malhar ne apni teacher ma'am se haskar poochha, \"Ma'am, kya khachchar aadhe samay ghoda aur aadhe samay gadha bana rehta hai?\"\n\nMa'am muskurayin: \"Bilkul nahi Malhar! Khachchar ek hi **asli, sthir (blended) jaanwar** hai jismein dono ke gun mile hue hain — wo kabhi ghode se gadhe mein flip nahi hota! Chemistry mein **Ozone (O₃)** aur **Carbonate (CO₃²⁻)** bhi bilkul aise hi hain: kaagaz par hum unke do ya teen alag Lewis structures banate hain, par asli molecule un sabka ek **sthir mila-jula roop (Resonance Hybrid)** hota hai!\" Chalo, Lattice Enthalpy, Formal Charge, Resonance aur Octet Rule ki seemaon ko samajhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Malhar apne school ke biology corner mein ek chart dekh raha tha: ek taraf ghoda (horse), doosri taraf gadha (donkey), aur beech mein **khachchar (mule)**. Malhar ne apni teacher ma'am se haskar poochha, \"Ma'am, kya khachchar aadhe samay ghoda aur aadhe samay gadha bana rehta hai?\"\n\nMa'am muskurayin: \"Bilkul nahi Malhar! Khachchar ek hi **asli, sthir (blended) jaanwar** hai jismein dono ke gun mile hue hain — wo kabhi ghode se gadhe mein flip nahi hota! Chemistry mein **Ozone (O₃)** aur **Carbonate (CO₃²⁻)** bhi bilkul aise hi hain: kaagaz par hum unke do ya teen alag Lewis structures banate hain, par asli molecule un sabka ek **sthir mila-jula roop (Resonance Hybrid)** hota hai!\" Chalo, Lattice Enthalpy, Formal Charge, Resonance aur Octet Rule ki seemaon ko samajhte hain."
