            "heading": "Key Vocabulary & Terms",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Lattice enthalpy (Δ_lattice H)** | 1 mole solid ionic crystal ko poori tarah alag-alag gaseous ions mein todne ke liye zaroori energy (kJ/mol) | NaCl(s) → Na⁺(g) + Cl⁻(g): +788 kJ/mol |\n| **Formal charge (FC)** | Lewis structure mein kisi ek atom par gina gaya hisaabi charge: FC = V − L − ½B | O₃ mein teeno O par +1, 0 aur −1 |\n| **Resonance (Canonical structures)** | Jab ek hi molecule ke liye do ya zyada barabar energy wale Lewis structures likhe ja sakein (sirf electrons ki jagah badle, atoms wahi rahein) | O₃ ke 2 aur CO₃²⁻ ke 3 canonical structures |\n| **Resonance hybrid** | Sabhi canonical structures ka asli, sabse kam energy wala, sthir mila-jula roop | O₃ mein dono O–O bonds barabar (128 pm) |\n| **Expanded octet** | Period 3 ya neeche ke central atom ke chaaron taraf 8 se zyada (10 ya 12) valence electrons hona | PCl₅ (10 e⁻), SF₆ (12 e⁻) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Lattice enthalpy (Δ_lattice H)** | 1 mole solid ionic crystal ko poori tarah alag-alag gaseous ions mein todne ke liye zaroori energy (kJ/mol) | NaCl(s) → Na⁺(g) + Cl⁻(g): +788 kJ/mol |\n| **Formal charge (FC)** | Lewis structure mein kisi ek atom par gina gaya hisaabi charge: FC = V − L − ½B | O₃ mein teeno O par +1, 0 aur −1 |\n| **Resonance (Canonical structures)** | Jab ek hi molecule ke liye do ya zyada barabar energy wale Lewis structures likhe ja sakein (sirf electrons ki jagah badle, atoms wahi rahein) | O₃ ke 2 aur CO₃²⁻ ke 3 canonical structures |\n| **Resonance hybrid** | Sabhi canonical structures ka asli, sabse kam energy wala, sthir mila-jula roop | O₃ mein dono O–O bonds barabar (128 pm) |\n| **Expanded octet** | Period 3 ya neeche ke central atom ke chaaron taraf 8 se zyada (10 ya 12) valence electrons hona | PCl₅ (10 e⁻), SF₆ (12 e⁻) |"
