            "body": "Topic 1 ke Lewis structures ne humein bataya ki kaun-sa atom kisse juda hai, par kaagaz par bane H−O−H ya N−H₃ ke chitra unka asli **3D aakaar (geometry)** nahi dikhate! 1940 mein Sidgwick-Powell aur 1957 mein Nyholm-Gillespie ne ek behad aasaan aur kamaal ka siddhant diya — **VSEPR Theory (Valence Shell Electron Pair Repulsion Theory)** — jisse bina kisi bade computer ke tum kisi bhi molecule ka 3D shape aur bond angle turant bata sakte ho! Iske saath hi hum **Bond Parameters**, **Dipole Moment (μ)** aur **Fajan's Rules** seekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 ke Lewis structures ne humein bataya ki kaun-sa atom kisse juda hai, par kaagaz par bane H−O−H ya N−H₃ ke chitra unka asli **3D aakaar (geometry)** nahi dikhate! 1940 mein Sidgwick-Powell aur 1957 mein Nyholm-Gillespie ne ek behad aasaan aur kamaal ka siddhant diya — **VSEPR Theory (Valence Shell Electron Pair Repulsion Theory)** — jisse bina kisi bade computer ke tum kisi bhi molecule ka 3D shape aur bond angle turant bata sakte ho! Iske saath hi hum **Bond Parameters**, **Dipole Moment (μ)** aur **Fajan's Rules** seekhenge."
