            "body": "Lewis structure mein O₂ ko **:Ö=Ö:** likhte hain — saare 16 electrons jode mein (paired) dikhte hain! Is hisaab se O₂ ko **diamagnetic** (chumbak se door bhagne wala) hona chahiye tha. Par jab scientists ne thandi liquid Oxygen ko ek strong magnet ke beech dala, to wo **magnet se chipak kar (paramagnetic)** ruk gayi! Is paheli ko 1932 mein Hund aur Mulliken ne **Molecular Orbital Theory (MOT)** se suljhaya — aur saath hi ye bhi bataya ki **He₂ aur Ne₂ kyun nahi bante** aur **O₂⁺, O₂ se zyada mazboot kyun hai!**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Lewis structure mein O₂ ko **:Ö=Ö:** likhte hain — saare 16 electrons jode mein (paired) dikhte hain! Is hisaab se O₂ ko **diamagnetic** (chumbak se door bhagne wala) hona chahiye tha. Par jab scientists ne thandi liquid Oxygen ko ek strong magnet ke beech dala, to wo **magnet se chipak kar (paramagnetic)** ruk gayi! Is paheli ko 1932 mein Hund aur Mulliken ne **Molecular Orbital Theory (MOT)** se suljhaya — aur saath hi ye bhi bataya ki **He₂ aur Ne₂ kyun nahi bante** aur **O₂⁺, O₂ se zyada mazboot kyun hai!**"
