            "heading": "Firoz aur talaab mein takrati do lehrein",
            "headingHinglish": "Firoz aur talaab mein takrati do lehrein",
            "body": "Firoz shaam ko talaab (pond) ke kinare baithkar do chhote patthar ek saath paani mein phenk raha tha. Do gol lehrein (ripples) phailti hui aapas mein takrayin! Jahan ek lehar ka **uncha hissa (crest)** doosri lehar ke **unche hisse (crest)** se mila, wahan paani aur **zyada uncha** uth gaya! Aur jahan ek ka **uncha hissa (crest)** doosre ke **gaddhe (trough)** se mila, wahan paani bilkul **chupchaap chapti (flat cancel)** ho gaya!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne muskurate hue kaha, \"Firoz, quantum mechanics mein electron bhi ek **wave (lehar)** hai! Jab do atoms ke atomic orbitals milte hain (LCAO — Linear Combination of Atomic Orbitals):\n- **Constructive overlap (+ +)** se kam energy wala **Bonding Molecular Orbital (σ, π)** banta hai — jo atoms ko jodta hai!\n- **Destructive overlap (+ −)** se zyada energy wala **Antibonding Molecular Orbital (σ*, π*)** banta hai — jo atoms ko alag dhakelta hai!\"\n\nChalo, MOT ke dono energy orders, Bond Order formula aur O₂ ke paramagnetism ka poora khel seekhte hain!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Firoz shaam ko talaab (pond) ke kinare baithkar do chhote patthar ek saath paani mein phenk raha tha. Do gol lehrein (ripples) phailti hui aapas mein takrayin! Jahan ek lehar ka **uncha hissa (crest)** doosri lehar ke **unche hisse (crest)** se mila, wahan paani aur **zyada uncha** uth gaya! Aur jahan ek ka **uncha hissa (crest)** doosre ke **gaddhe (trough)** se mila, wahan paani bilkul **chupchaap chapti (flat cancel)** ho gaya!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne muskurate hue kaha, \"Firoz, quantum mechanics mein electron bhi ek **wave (lehar)** hai! Jab do atoms ke atomic orbitals milte hain (LCAO — Linear Combination of Atomic Orbitals):\n- **Constructive overlap (+ +)** se kam energy wala **Bonding Molecular Orbital (σ, π)** banta hai — jo atoms ko jodta hai!\n- **Destructive overlap (+ −)** se zyada energy wala **Antibonding Molecular Orbital (σ*, π*)** banta hai — jo atoms ko alag dhakelta hai!\"\n\nChalo, MOT ke dono energy orders, Bond Order formula aur O₂ ke paramagnetism ka poora khel seekhte hain!"
