            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Hydrogen bond (H-bond)** | Jab H atom kisi chhote, behad electronegative atom (**F, O, ya N**) se juda ho, to us δ⁺ Hydrogen aur padosi F, O, ya N ke lone pair ke beech banne wala khaas electrostatic aakarshan (dotted line ··· se dikhate hain) | H−F ··· H−F, H₂O ··· H₂O |\n| **Intermolecular H-bonding** | **Do alag-alag molecules** ke beech banne wala H-bond — molecules aapas mein judkar chain/network bana lete hain (**boiling point BADHTA hai!**) | HF, H₂O, NH₃, ethanol, *p*-nitrophenol |\n| **Intramolecular H-bonding** | **Ek hi molecule ke andar** do groups ke beech banne wala H-bond (ring/chelation banata hai → **boiling point GHATTA hai**, steam-volatile!) | *o*-nitrophenol |\n| **Steam-volatile** | Wo compound jo bhaap (steam) ke saath aasani se bhaap bankar udd jaaye (low boiling point) | *o*-nitrophenol |",
