        "summaryHinglish": "Class 9 mein humne dekha tha ki kuch reactions heat bahar nikalte hain (exothermic) aur kuch heat andar lete hain (endothermic). Par Class 11 mein ek zaroori sawaal aata hai: jab koi reaction band rig",
