            "body": "Class 9 mein humne dekha tha ki kuch reactions heat bahar nikalte hain (**exothermic**) aur kuch heat andar lete hain (**endothermic**). Par Class 11 mein ek zaroori sawaal aata hai: jab koi reaction **band rigid bartan (constant volume)** mein hota hai, to heat **q_v = ΔU** hoti hai; par jab wahi reaction **khule beaker (constant atmospheric pressure)** mein hota hai, to kuch heat gas ko phailane (PΔV work) mein bhi kharch hoti hai! Is constant-pressure heat ko naapne ke liye hi **Enthalpy (H)** banayi gayi!",
