            "heading": "Avinash aur \"Thermo-Audit Desk\" Challenge",
            "headingHinglish": "Avinash aur \"Thermo-Audit Desk\" Challenge",
            "body": "Science exhibition mein **Avinash** ko **\"Thermo-Audit Desk\"** ka lead banaya gaya! Uske saamne **3 industrial process cards** rakhe the — (1) **Limestone Kiln**, (2) **NO → NO₂ Oxidation**, aur (3) **Clean Fuel Reaction**! Har card ko pass karne ke liye 4 checks poore karne the:\n- **Check 1:** Δn_g aur ΔH = ΔU + Δn_g RT\n- **Check 2:** Entropy (ΔS) ka sign aur unit (J → kJ!)\n- **Check 3:** Gibbs Energy (ΔG = ΔH − TΔS) aur Crossover Temperature\n- **Check 4:** Equilibrium Constant (K) from Δ_rG°!\n\nAvinash ne ek Golden Checklist board par chipkayi: **\"Units ek karo (kJ aur K!), gas moles gino, aur signs par nazar rakho!\"** Chalo, Avinash ke saath teeno multi-concept audit problems solve karte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Science exhibition mein **Avinash** ko **\"Thermo-Audit Desk\"** ka lead banaya gaya! Uske saamne **3 industrial process cards** rakhe the — (1) **Limestone Kiln**, (2) **NO → NO₂ Oxidation**, aur (3) **Clean Fuel Reaction**! Har card ko pass karne ke liye 4 checks poore karne the:\n- **Check 1:** Δn_g aur ΔH = ΔU + Δn_g RT\n- **Check 2:** Entropy (ΔS) ka sign aur unit (J → kJ!)\n- **Check 3:** Gibbs Energy (ΔG = ΔH − TΔS) aur Crossover Temperature\n- **Check 4:** Equilibrium Constant (K) from Δ_rG°!\n\nAvinash ne ek Golden Checklist board par chipkayi: **\"Units ek karo (kJ aur K!), gas moles gino, aur signs par nazar rakho!\"** Chalo, Avinash ke saath teeno multi-concept audit problems solve karte hain."
