            "body": "Lakshmi apni Mummy ke saath mall mein thi. Usne dekha ki ground floor se 1st floor par jaane wale escalator par har minute **15 log upar** ja rahe the, aur theek usi samay 1st floor se neeche aane wale escalator par har minute **15 log neeche** aa rahe the!\n\nLakshmi ne hairani se kaha, \"Mummy, 1st floor par har waqt lagbhag **200 log** hi dikh rahe hain — ginti bilkul badal nahi rahi, jabki ek bhi insaan ruka hua nahi hai!\"\n\nPhir food court mein Mummy ne ek **band chilled soda bottle** ka dhakkan khola — turant *fizzzzzz* ki aawaz ke saath CO₂ ke bulbule bahar bhaagne lage! Mummy muskurayin: \"Lakshmi, band bottle mein CO₂ gas aur liquid soda ke beech, aur mall ke escalator par — dono jagah **Dynamic Equilibrium** chal raha tha! Dono taraf ki gati chalu rehti hai, par **aage aur peeche ki raftaar barabar** hone se bahar se sab sthir (constant) dikhta hai!\" Chalo, physical aur chemical equilibrium ke saare kanoon seekhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Lakshmi apni Mummy ke saath mall mein thi. Usne dekha ki ground floor se 1st floor par jaane wale escalator par har minute **15 log upar** ja rahe the, aur theek usi samay 1st floor se neeche aane wale escalator par har minute **15 log neeche** aa rahe the!\n\nLakshmi ne hairani se kaha, \"Mummy, 1st floor par har waqt lagbhag **200 log** hi dikh rahe hain — ginti bilkul badal nahi rahi, jabki ek bhi insaan ruka hua nahi hai!\"\n\nPhir food court mein Mummy ne ek **band chilled soda bottle** ka dhakkan khola — turant *fizzzzzz* ki aawaz ke saath CO₂ ke bulbule bahar bhaagne lage! Mummy muskurayin: \"Lakshmi, band bottle mein CO₂ gas aur liquid soda ke beech, aur mall ke escalator par — dono jagah **Dynamic Equilibrium** chal raha tha! Dono taraf ki gati chalu rehti hai, par **aage aur peeche ki raftaar barabar** hone se bahar se sab sthir (constant) dikhta hai!\" Chalo, physical aur chemical equilibrium ke saare kanoon seekhte hain."
