            "heading": "Key Vocabulary & Terms",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Dynamic equilibrium** | Wo haalat jab **forward rate (r_f) = backward rate (r_b)** ho; macroscopically sab properties constant dikhti hain par microscopic level par dono reactions lagatar chalti rehti hain | Band bottle mein H₂O(l) ⇌ H₂O(g) |\n| **Henry's Law** | Constant temperature par kisi liquid mein ghuli hui gas ka mass, liquid ke upar us gas ke **pressure ke seedhe anupaat (directly proportional)** hota hai | Band soda bottle mein high pressure par zyada CO₂ ghuli rehti hai |\n| **Law of Mass Action** | Equilibrium par products ki concentrations (stoichiometric powers par) aur reactants ki concentrations ka anupaat ek constant (**K_c**) hota hai | aA + bB ⇌ cC + dD → K_c = [C]^c [D]^d ÷ ([A]^a [B]^b) |\n| **Homogeneous equilibrium** | Jab sabhi reactants aur products **ek hi phase** (jaise sab gas ya sab aqueous) mein hon | N₂(g) + 3H₂(g) ⇌ 2NH₃(g) |\n| **Heterogeneous equilibrium** | Jab reactants aur products **alag-alag phases** (jaise solid + gas) mein hon; pure solid/liquid ka active mass **1** liya jaata hai! | CaCO₃(s) ⇌ CaO(s) + CO₂(g) → K_p = p_CO₂ |",
