            "bodyHinglish": "Namrata pahadon ki trip par ek **jhoolte hue rassi ke pul (hanging rope bridge)** par chal rahi thi. Jaise hi tez hawa ne pul ko **baayin taraf (left)** dhakela, Namrata ne turant apna vazan thoda **daayin taraf (right)** jhuka kar santulan bana liya! Phir jab pul aage jhuka, to wo thoda peeche jhuki — har baar usne bahari dhakke ka **ulta asar** karke apna balance wapas paaya!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne muskurate hue kaha, \"Namrata, 1884 mein Henry Le Chatelier ne dekha ki chemical equilibrium bhi bilkul aisa hi karta hai! Jab bhi tum kisi equilibrium system par koi **stress** (concentration, pressure ya temperature ka badlaav) daalte ho, to system us disha mein khisak (shift) jaata hai jisse us stress ka asar **kam ya khatam** ho jaaye!\" Chalo, Q_c, ICE Table aur Le Chatelier ke paanchon factors ko poori gehraai se seekhte hain."
