            "bodyHinglish": "Dayanand ne glass ke paani mein thoda sa chauk/salt mila kar ghola — shuru mein thoda ghula, par phir ek patli safed parat glass ke tal mein baith gayi! Dayanand ne socha, \"Ab sab ruk gaya!\" Par teacher ma'am ne samjhaya: \"Nahi Dayanand, tal mein baithe solid se lagatar ions paani mein ghul rahe hain aur paani se utne hi ions wapas crystal par jam rahe hain — yahi **Solubility Equilibrium** hai!\"\n\nPhir teacher ma'am ne ek demo mein *(sirf dekhne ke liye — barium aur silver salts toxic hote hain!)* do bilkul **saaf, rangheen ghol** (BaCl₂ aur Na₂SO₄) ki boondein test tube mein milayin — aur turant ek **gaadha safed baadal (precipitate)** ban gaya! Ma'am muskurayin: \"Jab ions ka product (**Q_sp**) ek khaas seema (**K_sp**) ko paar kar jaata hai, to extra ions ghol mein nahi tik paate aur **precipitate** bankar neeche gir padte hain!\" Chalo, K_sp ka poora ganit seekhte hain."
