            "body": "Class 11 Chemistry fest mein **Vimal** ki team ko **\"Equilibrium Command Centre\"** ke 4 live stations sambhaalne the:\n- **Station 1 (Gas Reactor):** PCl₅ ke dissociation par ICE table, K_c, K_p aur Le Chatelier check!\n- **Station 2 (Formic Acid & Buffer Desk):** Ek hi acid (HCOOH) ke 3 bottles — pure acid, uska salt (HCOONa), aur dono ka buffer — teeno ka exact pH!\n- **Station 3 (Water-Treatment Precipitator):** Mg(OH)₂ ki solubility pure water mein banaam pH = 12 ke buffer mein!\n- **Station 4 (Thermo–K Bridge):** Chapter 5 ke Δ_rG° se K nikaalkar Q se reaction ki disha tay karna!\n\nVimal ne apni team ko yaad dilaya: **\"Har station par pehle species pehchano (gas, strong/weak acid, salt, buffer ya sparingly soluble salt) — phir seedha uska exact tool lagao!\"** Chalo, Vimal ke saath chaaron stations solve karte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 11 Chemistry fest mein **Vimal** ki team ko **\"Equilibrium Command Centre\"** ke 4 live stations sambhaalne the:\n- **Station 1 (Gas Reactor):** PCl₅ ke dissociation par ICE table, K_c, K_p aur Le Chatelier check!\n- **Station 2 (Formic Acid & Buffer Desk):** Ek hi acid (HCOOH) ke 3 bottles — pure acid, uska salt (HCOONa), aur dono ka buffer — teeno ka exact pH!\n- **Station 3 (Water-Treatment Precipitator):** Mg(OH)₂ ki solubility pure water mein banaam pH = 12 ke buffer mein!\n- **Station 4 (Thermo–K Bridge):** Chapter 5 ke Δ_rG° se K nikaalkar Q se reaction ki disha tay karna!\n\nVimal ne apni team ko yaad dilaya: **\"Har station par pehle species pehchano (gas, strong/weak acid, salt, buffer ya sparingly soluble salt) — phir seedha uska exact tool lagao!\"** Chalo, Vimal ke saath chaaron stations solve karte hain."
