            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Lohe mein jung lagna, mobile ki battery se bijli banna, gadiyon mein fuel jalna aur hamare sharir mein glucose se energy milna — in sab mein ek hi reaction chalti hai: **Redox Reaction (Reduction + Oxidation)**! Purani (classical) paribhasha mein sirf Oxygen jodna/hatana dekha jaata tha, par Class 11 mein hum iska asli aur sabse shaktishaali **Electronic Concept** aur **Oxidation Number (ON)** seekhenge — jisse hum kisi bhi reaction mein turant pehchaan sakein ki kisne electron diya, kisne liya, aur **CrO₅** ya **S₄O₆²⁻** jaise tricky molecules ka asli oxidation number kya hota hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Lohe mein jung lagna, mobile ki battery se bijli banna, gadiyon mein fuel jalna aur hamare sharir mein glucose se energy milna — in sab mein ek hi reaction chalti hai: **Redox Reaction (Reduction + Oxidation)**! Purani (classical) paribhasha mein sirf Oxygen jodna/hatana dekha jaata tha, par Class 11 mein hum iska asli aur sabse shaktishaali **Electronic Concept** aur **Oxidation Number (ON)** seekhenge — jisse hum kisi bhi reaction mein turant pehchaan sakein ki kisne electron diya, kisne liya, aur **CrO₅** ya **S₄O₆²⁻** jaise tricky molecules ka asli oxidation number kya hota hai!"
