            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Combination redox** | Do ya zyada species (kam se kam ek **elemental form** mein!) judkar ek compound banayein: A + B → C | C(s) + O₂(g) → CO₂(g); 3Mg + N₂ → Mg₃N₂ |\n| **Decomposition redox** | Ek compound tootkar do ya zyada products banaye jinmein kam se kam ek **elemental form** mein ho | 2KClO₃ → 2KCl + 3O₂ *(CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂ redox NAHI hai!)* |\n| **Displacement redox** | Ek atom/ion kisi compound mein doosre atom/ion ki jagah le le: X + YZ → XZ + Y | Zn + CuSO₄ → ZnSO₄ + Cu; Cl₂ + 2KBr → 2KCl + Br₂ |\n| **Disproportionation** | Wo khaas redox reaction jismein **EK HI tatva** (beech ke intermediate ON mein) ek saath **oxidise (ON ↑)** bhi ho aur **reduce (ON ↓)** bhi! | 2H₂O₂ (−1) → 2H₂O (−2) + O₂ (0) |\n| **Comproportionation** | Disproportionation ka theek ulta — ek hi tatva ke do alag ON wale species milkar beech ka ek common ON banayein! | IO₃⁻ (+5) + 5I⁻ (−1) + 6H⁺ → 3I₂ (0) + 3H₂O |",
