            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Galti 1: Har decomposition reaction ko redox maan lena!**\n   **CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂** aur **NH₄Cl → NH₃ + HCl** decomposition to hain, par **NON-REDOX** hain kyunki kisi atom ka ON nahi badalta!\n\n2. **Galti 2: Fluorine (F₂) ka Cl₂ ki tarah alkali mein disproportionation likh dena.**\n   F kabhi positive ON nahi dikha sakta — isliye **F₂ kabhi disproportionate nahi karta**!\n\n3. **Galti 3: ClO₄⁻ (perchlorate) ka disproportionation dikha dena.**\n   ClO₄⁻ mein Cl pehle se apne **maximum ON (+7)** par hai — ye aur upar oxidise nahi ho sakta! Sirf **ClO⁻ (+1), ClO₂⁻ (+3) aur ClO₃⁻ (+5)** disproportionate kar sakte hain!"
