            "bodyHinglish": "1828 se pehle scientists maante the ki organic compounds (jaise urea, sugar, DNA) sirf jeevit sharir ki kisi jaadui **\"Vital Force\"** se hi ban sakte hain — lab mein nahi! Par 1828 mein **Friedrich Wöhler** ne inorganic salt **ammonium cyanate (NH₄CNO)** ko garam karke lab mein pehla organic compound **Urea (NH₂CONH₂)** bana diya aur Vital Force Theory ko hamesha ke liye khatam kar diya! Aaj hum Carbon ki hybridisation, **1°/2°/3°/4° carbons**, **Bond-Line aur 3D Wedge-Dash** formulas, aur organic compounds ka poora **Classification Tree** (benzenoid, non-benzenoid aur heterocyclic sahit!) seekhenge."
