            "headingHinglish": "Aam galtiyan (mixed organic questions mein bachke rehna)",
            "body": "1. **Galti 1: Lassaigne's test mein Blood-Red ([Fe(SCN)]²⁺) aur Prussian Blue (Fe₄[Fe(CN)₆]₃) ko aapas mein badal dena!**\n   - Sirf **N** → **Prussian Blue**!\n   - **N aur S DONO** → **Blood-Red**!\n\n2. **Galti 2: Carbocation stability order (3° > 2° > 1°) ko Carbanion par bhi laga dena.**\n   Carbanions mein +I groups −ve charge ko destabilise karte hain → order bilkul **ulta (CH₃⁻ > 1° > 2° > 3°)** hota hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Galti 1: Lassaigne's test mein Blood-Red ([Fe(SCN)]²⁺) aur Prussian Blue (Fe₄[Fe(CN)₆]₃) ko aapas mein badal dena!**\n   - Sirf **N** → **Prussian Blue**!\n   - **N aur S DONO** → **Blood-Red**!\n\n2. **Galti 2: Carbocation stability order (3° > 2° > 1°) ko Carbanion par bhi laga dena.**\n   Carbanions mein +I groups −ve charge ko destabilise karte hain → order bilkul **ulta (CH₃⁻ > 1° > 2° > 3°)** hota hai!"
