            "bodyHinglish": "Santosh ne ek straw (axle) ke dono siron par **do teen-pankhudi wali kagaz ki phirkiyan (pinwheels)** lagayin. Jab usne aage wali phirki ko ghumaya, to do khaas haalatein banin:\n1. **Eclipsed haalat:** Aage wale teen pankh theek peeche wale teen pankhon ke **seedhe saamne (0° par)** aa gaye — sab ek-doosre ke bahut paas aur bheed mein!\n2. **Staggered haalat:** Aage wale pankh peeche wale pankhon ke **theek beech ki khaali jagah (60° par)** aa gaye — sabse zyada khuli jagah aur sabse kam takraav!\n\nTeacher ma'am ne muskurate hue kaha, \"Santosh, **Ethane (CH₃−CH₃)** ke C−C single bond par free rotation hone se bilkul yahi **infinite Conformations** bante hain — jinmein **Staggered sabse zyada stable** aur **Eclipsed sabse kam stable** hota hai!\" Chalo, alkanes ki poori chemistry seekhte hain."
