            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Galti 1: HCl + Peroxide ya HI + Peroxide mein bhi Anti-Markovnikov product likh dena!**\n   *Sahi baat:* Peroxide effect **SIRF HBr** ke saath chalta hai! HCl ya HI mein peroxide hone par bhi **Markovnikov** product hi banta hai!\n\n2. **Galti 2: 2-Bromobutane + alc. KOH mein but-1-ene ko major product likh dena.**\n   Saytzeff's rule se zyada substituted alkene (**but-2-ene**, 6 α-H) hamesha major hota hai!\n\n3. **Galti 3: Lindlar's catalyst aur Na/liq. NH₃ ke *cis/trans* products ko ulta kar dena.**\n   Yaad rakhne ki trick: **Lindlar → *cis***; **Na / liq. NH₃ → *trans***!"
